  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SPVO &#x2013; Optimising strategies to address the living income &#x2013; Child labour nexus</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of this project is to help organisations optimise their Living Income &#x2013; Child Labour (LI-CL) strategies, including those funded by the Subsidy Programme for Responsible Business (SPVO), and to inform ongoing and new pilot projects testing novel approaches.This project envisions that ultimately, this should lead to a better understanding of which approaches work best in different combinations and contexts and facilitate the scaling up of this knowledge, such that companies and other organisations can adopt more effective LI-CL approaches.</narrative>
  </description>
